{"title":"会员动态 | 广东建工监理完成DeepSeek私域化部署","date":"2025-04-15","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"article135\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t<section data-color=\"#1e9be8\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.578px; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; height: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t<h1 class=\"rich_media_title\" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">会员动态 | 广东建工监理完成DeepSeek私域化部署</span></h1>\r\n\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\">\r\n\t\t<section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"139296\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 1px solid #b2e5a6;border-radius: 8px;padding: 0 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border: 1px solid #b2e5a6;padding: 14px 10px 25px;border-radius: 10px;margin: -6px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(59, 59, 59); background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t广东省建筑工程监理有限公司积极响应集团&ldquo;管理+互联网&rdquo;的战略，抢抓人工智能发展的历史性机遇，全面推进&ldquo;人工智能+咨询服务&rdquo;落地，公司数智化管理平台已完成DeepSeek-R1满血版的私域部署，AI智能系统&ldquo;筑芯AI&rdquo;（又名&ldquo;铸星&rdquo;）今日同步正式上线运行。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t该系统深度融合工程管理场景需求，以&ldquo;智能技术为芯，数智管理为脉&rdquo;为核心理念，标志着公司在工程监理咨询领域实现从经验驱动向数据智能驱动的跨越式升级，为打造华南地区工程咨询标杆企业注入强劲科技动能。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 40px;margin-left: auto;margin-top: -20px;margin-right: 15px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 7px 0px 0px; width: 100%; align-self: flex-start; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-top-color: rgb(142, 201, 101); height: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p leaf=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: center; margin: 10px 0px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100026267\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/2-1(1).png\" style=\"width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); white-space-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10