box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.2px;width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.14117em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&ldquo;筑芯AI&rdquo;以&ldquo;DeepSeek-R1模型+N智能体应用&rdquo;为核心架构，集成约2万条私域知识与工程建设标准规范数据、向量数据库、RAG（检索增强生成）、多模态数据分析等前沿技术，构建覆盖全业务链的智能中枢。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.14117em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.75em; text-indent: 2.14117em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t系统通过自然语言处理实现高效人机交互，依托ES搜索引擎和视频智能分析技术，实时解析海量工程数据，精准预测项目风险；结合AI写作与智能审查功能，自动化生成高精度报告与合规表单，将传统人工耗时缩短80%，进一步提升职工业务能力，显著提升业务响应效率。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); white-space-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 0%;line-height: 0;height: auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 3px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: 5px;align-self: flex-end;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;transform: rotateZ(45deg);-webkit-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-moz-transform: rotateZ(45deg);-o-transform: rotateZ(45deg);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: bor