2.14117em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">人机协同：</strong>拟人化&ldquo;小芯&rdquo;设计，在提升效率的同时保留服务温度，实现科技与人文的平衡。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); white-space-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 20px 0px; width: 100%; align-self: flex-start; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 0px; border-color: rgb(142, 201, 101) rgb(248, 107, 74); padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: -20px 0px;width: 100%;align-self: flex-start;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 1px;border-color: #f86b4a #8ec965;padding: 10px;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 14px 0px;line-height: 0;width: 100%;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-radius: 20px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-imgfileid=\"100026266\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202504/2-2(1).png\" style=\"width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); white-space-collapse: collapse; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: inline-block; width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgb(142, 201, 101); padding: 10px; box-shadow: rgb(204, 204, 204) 0.2em 0.2e